invariant: INV-67
file: src/mldsa_vector.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mldsa-vector
reason: the AVX2 inverse transform gives the four groups of its layer of
  span 2 their twiddle factors in the wrong order: each pair of groups
  takes the other's. Every twiddle is still one the loop reads in that
  layer, so the error shows only where the coefficients differ between
  groups. bin/mldsa_vector_equiv_test compares every coefficient with
  both loops over random and single-coefficient inputs. Only an x86-64
  compiler reads the line, so the script builds the binary for x86-64
  and runs it under qemu-x86_64, whose max model has AVX2.

--- old
_mm256_setr_epi32(7, 7, 6, 6, 5, 5, 4, 4)
--- new
_mm256_setr_epi32(6, 6, 7, 7, 4, 4, 5, 5)
